@startuml ColdChainTrace_Data_Flow

title ColdChainTrace - Data Flow

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "Physical Environment" {

    component "Temperature Sensor" as Sensor

    component "ESP32\nEmbedded Node" as ESP32
}

rectangle "IoT Communication" {

    component "MQTT Broker" as MQTT
}

rectangle "ColdChainTrace Backend" {

    component "Telemetry Ingestion" as Ingestion

    component "Validation Engine" as Validation

    component "Alert Service" as Alerts

    component "Traceability Service" as Traceability

    database "SQL Server" as Database

    component "Data Integrity Layer" as Integrity
}

rectangle "Monitoring" {

    component "Dashboard" as Dashboard
}

Sensor --> ESP32 : 1. Temperature measurement

ESP32 --> MQTT : 2. Publish telemetry

MQTT --> Ingestion : 3. Receive telemetry

Ingestion --> Validation : 4. Validate reading

Validation --> Database : 5. Store reading

Validation --> Alerts : 6. Generate alert\nif threshold is violated

Ingestion --> Traceability : 7. Create traceability record

Traceability --> Integrity : 8. Generate integrity proof

Integrity --> Database : 9. Store integrity data

Database --> Dashboard : 10. Historical telemetry

Alerts --> Dashboard : 11. Alerts

Ingestion --> Dashboard : 12. Live telemetry

@enduml